      <activity id="ed91b95d-3787-5885-b4e5-91d948f235dc" activityNameId="809153ff-38cf-55fa-a2d4-5211771b7efd" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, electric vehicle, LiMn2O4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, electric vehicle, LiMn2O4
The maintenance of the battery electric vehicle is derived from the maintenance of a conventional passenger car. Additionally, the battery replacement is included (312kg). Life expectancy of battery pack: 100'000 km.;
UUID: 2b8c1181-95d8-3a0b-9d28-a0b17d907a71
The inventory includes materials used for alteration parts and energy consumption of garages. Rail and road transport of materials is accounted for. Battery pack replacement and disposal included
Location: Data represent Swiss conditions, but are also valid for other European countries
Technology: Middle class passsenger car using a LiMn2O4 battery pack, 100Wh/kg, 312 kg
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data is derived from LCI of a Golf A4. 
Extrapolations: Data  for Germany is used as an estimate for Europe
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2b8c1181-95d8-3a0b-9d28-a0b17d907a71.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
